Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO! YAMOO! YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Mai's really got Yugi on the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's brought him down to 300 life\Npoints, and she hasn't lost any.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Mai's Shadow\Nof Eyes card is active,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't play any of my\Nmonsters in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I try to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,my monsters lose half their power\Nwhen they hit Mai's mirror wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't risk turning you loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.09,0:01:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yu-Gi-Boy seems to\Nhave a lot on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense much conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of embracing the\Npower of his Millennium Item,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he seems to be struggling\Nagainst its forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and that will be his undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone and put aside all of her silly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,card tricks and played\Nthis duel flawlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought she was this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that it was just sheer\Ndumb luck that I beat her before?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't luck, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost that duel to you because\Nyou knew something I didn't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned more from that duel\Nthan any other I've ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned a lesson from you that day\Nthat I never really wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it then, but it would\Nchange me and the way I looked at dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to take a hard look\Nat myself and admit that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the reason I relied on tricks\Nwas because I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid to trust in my own abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid to trust in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you trusted in yourself, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And facing up to that\Nwasn't easy, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really changed, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.65,0:02:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, do you know how you made it all the\Nway to the final round of this tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it this far\Nbecause I got my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and Tristan and Téa\Nand Bakura behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,cheering me on and telling\Nme that I can go all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends were with you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But you also had the guts to look inside\Nand face up to what you saw there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked your demons in\Nthe eye and dealt with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a lesson everyone should learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I did that? That's right. In that game,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you taught me that a\Nduelist can learn more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,from her defeats than from her victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me to face up to my fears,\Nnot just try to bottle them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugi, have you faced up to your fears?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever freaked you out in your battle\Nwith Kaiba, have you come to grips with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba was willing to risk everything\Nin our duel And the spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,from my Millennium Puzzle was\Nwilling to do anything to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender unless you have the courage to\Nunleash your monster But if I had attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba might have been seriously hurt Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't let that happen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it cost me the duel No\Nmatter how badly I need to rescue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Hurting someone else is\Nsomething I will not do I meant no harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to help And I vow never\Nto go against your wishes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather once urged you to trust\Nin the power of the Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for reminding me that a\Ntrue duelist faces his problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was holding back, but not any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a little late to the party, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been dueling for real all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, you promised\Nwe'd do this my way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And my word is my bond. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card, Brain Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Brain Control? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,With this card, I can brainwash one\Nenemy monster and control it for a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it to seize control\Nof Harpy's Pet Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But Harpy's pet dragon is only a servant\Nof Harpy Lady and even brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,it would never think of\Nturning on its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you just made your final mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, even under brain control,\NHarpy's Peten won't attack her master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, Mai, but I don't\Nintend to attack your Harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I play this card face\Ndown and add Catapult Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's put Harpy's pet dragon\Non the catapult in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've called an attack,\Nyour mirror wall appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to knock it\Ndown with your own dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Catapult Turtle has the power\Nto destroy walls and fortresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Catapult, launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He shattered my mirror wall to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all I've done, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My assault has accomplished more than\Nto destroy the defense you built.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was your monster\NI fired from Catapult Turtle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,half of the Pet Dragon's attack points\Nget deducted from your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The tide of this battle is turning, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're sucking it through, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Most unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Yugi boy has somehow\Nbegun to regain his inner strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted my best, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're about to get your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can trust the spirit of my Millennium\NPuzzle, if we can really work together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,then nothing can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, the only monster Yugi's got on\Nthe field is that reptilian launch pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I could send Harpy Lady to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Yugi's life points would drop\Nto zero and I'd be the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's that other\Ncard he's laid face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's a trap, I'd be walking right\Ninto it and that could finish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the toughest decision\NI've had to make all game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To attack or not to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring on your assault, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will not attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not falling into your trap and\Nthere are other moves that I can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, I can use this card\Nto triple my harpy attack force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Elegant Egotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn, Yugi,\Nbut next time around,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get a taste of my lady's claws,\Nand I promise you won't enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should have attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:07:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had called an attack,\Nthen you would have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But your trap card...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a trap, Mai. It's\Na monster recovery card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell from my bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a whole new duel now, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For this turn, I'll activate\Nthe monster recovery card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull all my monsters back into my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,reshuffle, and now I\Ncan draw five new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not one of these cards is strong\Nenough to bring down Mai's harpies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of my three harpy ladies\Nnow has an attack power of 2450.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only a handful\Nof cards in all of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters that can\Nstand up against that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and from the look on your face, you\Nhaven't drawn one. Yugi! Don't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a monster on the field, Mice\Nfree to attack my life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never survive against her, unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This card, in defensive mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow of Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It lures all monsters into\Nattack mode, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mai, and that's what'll\Nsave my life points this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow of Eyes may lure men into battle,\Nbut it doesn't work on female monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to attack it\Ninstead of me. Made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of his life points intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, he may have gotten\Nthrough this turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but that does not mean he's\Nout of the woods just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't take my long to\Ndestroy that mystical elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so let's see where we stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the board with one\Nmeasly elf, and it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll use this Monster Reborn\Ncard to bring back an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Reborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Harpy's pet dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,he's back and he gets\N300 more attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for each harpy on the\Nfield oh no he now has 2
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,,900 attack points and\Nevery single point aimed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,right at you harpy\Nladies combine your power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,exterminator attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,she wiped out his last defense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time's run out, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, I eliminate the\Nremainder of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, looks like\NI go on to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He might as well admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing he can do against\Nmy monster's attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One more turn and it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there must be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I need more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The next card I draw is going to\Ndecide the fate of so many lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens if I draw the wrong card?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To Joey and his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And to Kaiba and Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do this. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me, and trust\Nin the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know I'll wipe out any\Ncard you play on my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of Revealing Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of Revealing Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually drew Swords\Nof Revealing Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How can anybody be that lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that holds Mai at bay\Nfor three turns and buys
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi some time to figure\Na way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Decided to go down fighting,\Nhuh? Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A surrender would be easier,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're really determined\Nto go out in a blaze of glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be only too happy to\Nlight the fire. No, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What I intend to do is to go\Nout in a blaze of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's pet dragon is the most\Npowerful monster she's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we can defeat it,\Nthere's no way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can defeat it, but only at great risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It involves the Black Luster Ritual,\Nand three turns might not be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Luster Ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can draw the correct\Ncards, you'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My only move for this turn, I play Karibu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the attack of the giant\Nthree-toed hairball. Look, it's totally
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,ferocious yuki i think it wants to\Nattack harpy's pet dragon single-handed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,what you don't think that's\Nfunny yuki it's not my laugh all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you want but don't mistake the\Nkaribo for a joke when it's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,an important step on my way\Nto victory in this duel That
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,hairball couldn't be an important\Nstep on the way to anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,except maybe choking a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't attack as long as Swords\Nof Revealing Light is still in play, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I draw this one card, and\Nthat will end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon, you're gonna be history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.31,0:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That Kaiba was a good start,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but with just the cards\NI've got in my hand now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't initiate the Blackluster Ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need one more card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the card I need
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of\Nmaneuver you're trying to pull,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,kiddo But go for it If you've got to lose,\Nyou might as well lose with some flair
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This card worked for you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Reborn
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I use Monster Reborn to bring back Gaia,\Nthe Fierce Knight Oh, Fierce Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorcerer Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he's an improvement\Nover that little Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.03,0:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But he hardly represents a threat to\Nmy harpies and their supercharged pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Two turns to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be enough, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just maintain your cool, Taya. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell from the look in his\Neyes he's not about to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Very daring, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to attempt a\Nlegendary black luster ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've only one turn left in\Nwhich to draw the necessary card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really prepared to risk everything\Non the outcome of a single draw? Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew another Harpy Lady card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,On my next turn, I can play this card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me a total of four harpies and\Nraising pet dragon's attack power to 3200.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Yugi's Swords of Revealing Light\Nwear off, it's all over for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai isn't even trying\Nto hide her next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got so much firepower, she\Nthinks she's got this in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn is over, as are the effects\Nof your Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't get much help out of your\Nthree free turns, did you, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I-I don't think I\Ncan do this. Yugi was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there's too much writing\Non the draw of a single
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Card, who am I to gamble\Nwith the lives of Yugi's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends and family and what\Nwill happen if I should fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,there's too much riding on the draw\Nof this next card i shouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Risking Yugi's friends and family\Nthis way, it's too dangerous. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we can do it together yugi i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,with you and we're not alone we have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the support of all my friends just\Nlike i've had from the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:16:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With all of you at my side,\NI was foolish to lose faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have to trust in each\Nother and in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we put our hearts in the\Ngame, there's nothing we can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt such tremendous strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put up a good fight,\Nbut now the duel ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with this card,\NBlackluster Ritual. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the Blackluster Ritual\Nworks by sacrificing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the monsters I\Nhave placed on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Combining the energies of my two separate
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters And
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:17:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,the forces
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of light and darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,intertwine Opening the gates of chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bringing forth Oh no
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Luster Soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really the legendary\NBlack Luster Soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Black Luster Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaos Blade attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's pet dragon is vanquished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.09,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, my most\Npowerful monster, it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is outstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For a minute there, I really didn't\Nthink that Yugi'd be able to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think Mai did, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought there'd\Nbe a way of bringing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that kick-butt monster out of Yugi's deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.27,0:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's lost the will to fight on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One turn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd only been able\Nto play one more Harpy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady card before the\NBlackluster Soldier appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't revive the pet dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no other card in my deck\Nthat can defeat that ultimate warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So does this mean that\Nyou surrender? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When a duelist places their\Nhand over the deck like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it means they concede the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.83,0:18:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not see my harpy\Nladies destroyed in the next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is yours, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You said a duelist can learn more from\Ndefeat than victory, and you were correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, Mai, you taught me a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to confront my own\Nfears, my own weaknesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,or I could never have defeated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awfully nice of\Nyou to say that, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems to me I also\Nstill have a lot more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,About dueling and about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I suppose no duelist\Never learns all there is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe the most important lesson is\Nthat defeat doesn't have to be forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You won this duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But there'll be others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I will meet in\Nthe arena again, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we do, you better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
